  in_=["A CPU tool that re-derives section paths from stored standards blocks with the CQ-12/13 functions into a derived column or copy (the default, until F7 is answered), then `app.rechunk` on a database copy and a clone of the standards collection, with CQ-8 reuse, GPU embed of the changed chunks only."],
